          "text": "Build a Note Splitter in Python"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1f2ee648e796",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "This walkthrough splits a long page into notes, one function per step."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43f32579e684",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Last updated: March 2026.",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The steps work with any recent Python 3 release."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fca3d75f36e7",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "1-the-steps",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "1. The Steps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5ec81cb9257b",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The pipeline has three steps:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6f50283b7bfd",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "plaintext",
      "text": "1. Fetch Page     → Download the HTML\n2. Split Sections → One note per heading\n3. Render Notes   → Write Markdown files"
    },
    {
      "id": "109020c388bc",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Each step takes the previous step's output."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fe49f79c6201",
      "kind": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "bd40fa1de500",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "2-set-up",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "2. Set Up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d78b096719b8",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "bash",
      "text": "pip install notesplit"
    },
    {
      "id": "de85fd242308",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "warning",
      "title": "Caution",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "fd1866bdb22e",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Use a virtual environment so the install stays local."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "68a6504aff76",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "split-sections",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Split Sections"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "619631af64b7",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "python",
      "text": "def split(html: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Return one chunk per <h2>.\"\"\"\n\n    return html.split(\"<h2>\")",
      "title": "split.py"
    },
    {
      "id": "7df05a1073d6",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "title": "Tip",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e6b52a2f3bd2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Keep each step a plain function so it is easy to test."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
